ItemReworks: {
	AmethystStaff:
		'''
		Shoots piercing amethyst bolts.
		Right-click to create a phantom copy behind the player that rapidly shoots amethyst bolts.
		This ability has a 15 seconds cooldown before it can be used again.
		'''
	DiamondStaff:
		'''
		Spawns diamond bolts that leech the mana off the hit enemies. 
		Right-click to create a large diamond that will cover the player. 
		This diamond reflects all hostile projectiles that touch it, halving their damage. 
		On the 5th hit, the diamond shatters and launches the damaging shards that fly in all directions, also giving the player 30 iframes. 
		This ability has a 15 second cooldown before it can be used again.
		'''
	EmeraldStaff:
		'''
		Rapidly shoots emerald bolts.
		Hit enemies with this weapon to form a large emerald that can be launched into a nearby enemy and will split into a large amount of damaging shards.
		While holding the staff, the holder's movement speed is increased by 10%.
		'''
	FusedGemstoneStaff:
		'''
		Randomly fires projectiles from all previous gem staves.
		'The ultimate Gem Staff.'
		'''
	SapphireStaff:
		'''
		Fires sapphire bolts that slow down enemies. 
		Right-click to create a large sapphire in the cursor potion that can store multiple sapphire bolts when they hit it.
		Right-click again to launch the sapphire, hitting it again with any projectile will destroy it and release the homing sapphire bolts.
		'''
	RubyStaff:
		'''
		Launches piercing ruby bolts.
		Right-click to spawn a large ruby that pulls the ruby bolts towards it.
		When these bolts hit the large ruby, it will reflect them with 150% of their original velocity and cause them to slowly home into the nearby enemies.
		Has a small chance to supercharge ruby bolts when reflecting them, supercharged ruby bolts pierce infinitely and fly with 250% of their original velocity.
		'''
	TopazStaff:
		'''
		Hold left-click to charge an erratic spread of topaz bolts. 
		While holding the weapon, the holder's defense is increased by 5.
		'''
}

